-- examples/checks/agg-tagc-budget.rofl — agg_tagc_budget: the budget cuts the
-- evaluation of agg-budget-data.rofl while ab_r is still being derived, and
-- a counting tag over it, the number of ways each node is reached, is no
-- answer: the cut is a hole on the world, and the tag has no row at all,
-- never a count of what arrived before the wall.
-- expect-row: hole[$kernel]($adhoc,budget_exhausted)
-- expect-no-row: tcb_n[main](
tag tcb_n(C, counting N).
tcb_n(C, N) :- ab_r(_, C, _).
